{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "%@ · %@": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@ · 用时 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ · took %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ → %@": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%@ 未连接": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ not connected"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 未连接，到时会跳过": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ not connected, will be skipped"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "%lld 个任务需要注意": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld task needs attention"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld tasks need attention"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 个任务，全部正常": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld task, all good"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld tasks, all good"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 项": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld item"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld items"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1. 点「打开系统设置」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. Click “Open System Settings”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. 点列表下方的 ＋，在「应用程序」里选择 SyncDock": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Click ＋ below the list and choose SyncDock in Applications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. 打开 SyncDock 旁边的开关，然后回到这里": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Turn on the switch next to SyncDock, then come back here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SyncDock": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "SyncDock 主窗口": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SyncDock Main Window"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SyncDock 会按计划在后台同步文件夹。开始之前，先完成下面这一步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SyncDock syncs your folders in the background on a schedule. Before you start, complete the step below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SyncDock 没有完全磁盘访问权限，无法同步。请在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 完全磁盘访问权限」里打开 SyncDock 的开关；如果已经打开，先关掉再重新打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SyncDock doesn't have Full Disk Access, so it couldn't sync. Turn on SyncDock in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Full Disk Access; if it's already on, turn it off and on again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SyncDock 还没有完全磁盘访问权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SyncDock doesn't have Full Disk Access yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
