    "去设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set Up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "变动明细": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只删除这个同步任务和它的定时设置（会移到废纸篓），已经同步过去的文件不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the task and its schedule are deleted (moved to the Trash). Files that were already synced stay where they are."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只在你点「立即同步」时同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Syncs only when you click Sync Now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只能排除源文件夹里面的项目。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only items inside the source folder can be excluded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可以选择源文件夹里的文件夹或文件，也可以填名称（支持 * 和 ? 通配符），名称在每一层都会排除。被排除的项目不会同步，目标里已有的也不会被删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose folders or files inside the source, or enter a name (* and ? wildcards work); a name is excluded at every level. Excluded items aren't synced, and copies already in the destination aren't deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步出错": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步出错（%lld 个错误），点菜单栏里的任务查看详情": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Sync failed (%lld error). Click the task in the menu bar to see what happened."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Sync failed (%lld errors). Click the task in the menu bar to see what happened."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步到：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Syncs to: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步成功": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync succeeded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步方式": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sync Method"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同步被中断，下次会从中断处继续。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sync was interrupted; the next run picks up where it left off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名为这个的项目，在每一层都会排除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Items with this name, excluded at every level"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名称": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名称，例如 node_modules 或 *.log": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name, e.g. node_modules or *.log"
          }
        }
      }
    },
