      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get Started"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开机登录后在菜单栏显示同步状态": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show sync status in the menu bar after you log in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开 SyncDock": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open SyncDock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开系统设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把新增和修改过的文件复制到目标，不删除目标里的任何文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copies new and changed files to the destination. Nothing in the destination is ever deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拷贝路径": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy Path"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "排除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exclude"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "排除 %lld 项": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld excluded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "排除隐藏文件（以 . 开头的文件和文件夹）": {
